---
<section class="hero-section section-padding">
  <div class="container hero-container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-badge-wrapper">
        <img src="https://nutrineyfelipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Frame-4392.svg" alt="Formação Nutrição Avançada" class="hero-badge-img" />
      </div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Chegou sua hora de <span class="highlight-blue">Viver de Atendimentos</span> e se tornar um Nutricionista Avançado, reconhecido e valorizado.
      </h1>
      
      <div class="hero-bullets">
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#21C768" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="bullet-icon"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
          <span>Tudo o que precisa para viver de atendimentos em uma única formação.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#21C768" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="bullet-icon"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
          <span>Saiba como Entregar um Acompanhamento Nutricional de alto valor que engaja os pacientes.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#21C768" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="bullet-icon"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
          <span>Entregar resultados duradouros com uma prática embasada em ciência.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#21C768" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="bullet-icon"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
          <span>Aprenda o Método Nutrição Avançada para atender com segurança.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#21C768" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="bullet-icon"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
          <span>Domine a arte das prescrições que vão além das calorias.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-cta-wrapper">
        <a href="https://clkdmg.site/pay/fna-t7" class="btn-shiny hero-btn">→ QUERO FAZER MINHA INSCRIÇÃO</a>
        <div class="hero-guarantee">
          <span class="tag-item">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="svg-subtle"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            Garantia Incondicional de 7 Dias
          </span>
          <span class="tag-item">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="svg-subtle"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
            Acesso Imediato
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-video-wrapper">
      <div class="glass-panel video-panel">
        <div class="video-container">
          <iframe 
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/FkYUYm3vwnA?autoplay=0&rel=0&modestbranding=1" 
            title="Vídeo de Apresentação da Formação Nutrição Avançada" 
            frameborder="0" 
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" 
            allowfullscreen 
            loading="lazy"
            class="youtube-iframe">
          </iframe>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="urgency-bar-wrapper">
    <div class="container urgency-container">
      <img src="https://nutrineyfelipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Seta-laranja-2-1.svg" alt="Seta Laranja" class="urgency-arrow arrow-left" />
      <div class="urgency-items">
        <div class="urgency-pill">
          <span class="pill-icon">🎁</span>
          <span>Somente hoje: <strong>Biblioteca de Agentes de Inteligência Artificial</strong></span>
        </div>
        <div class="urgency-pill">
          <span class="pill-icon">🎁</span>
          <span><strong>100 primeiros:</strong> R$400 de desconto.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="urgency-pill">
          <span class="pill-icon">🎁</span>
          <span><strong>2 anos de acesso à plataforma de conteúdos:</strong> Economia de R$997 na sua renovação.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img src="https://nutrineyfelipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Seta-laranja-3.svg" alt="Seta Laranja" class="urgency-arrow arrow-right" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 140px;
    padding-bottom: 60px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top center, rgba(0, 140, 255, 0.28), transparent 40%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-bg-blue-dark) 0%, var(--color-bg-primary) 100%);
  }
  .hero-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }
  .hero-badge-wrapper {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .hero-badge-img {
    height: 38px;
    width: auto;
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3.4rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .highlight-blue {
    color: #04DCFC;
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(4, 220, 252, 0.4);
  }
  .hero-bullets {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .bullet-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .bullet-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .hero-btn {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 440px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .hero-guarantee {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .tag-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .svg-subtle {
    color: var(--color-accent-cyan);
  }
  .video-panel {
    padding: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border-radius: 32px;
  }
  .video-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0A1325, #050B14);
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }
  .youtube-iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: none;
  }

  /* Urgency Bar */
  .urgency-bar-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .urgency-container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 32px 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02));
    backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(190%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }
  .urgency-arrow {
    height: 48px;
    width: auto;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .urgency-items {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }
  .urgency-pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }
  .pill-icon {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1200px) {
    .urgency-container {
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .urgency-arrow {
      display: none;
    }
    .urgency-items {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .urgency-pill {
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .hero-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 56px;
    }
    .hero-badge-wrapper {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .hero-bullets {
      align-items: center;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .hero-guarantee {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 576px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
    .hero-guarantee {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .urgency-pill {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      padding: 12px 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
